 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f_VEVSHy8aoQ7kNvwFON2VV&_nc_oc=AdrR_yN63iThQGkpd4gk2ljrdE4XVKPsgkZiNWtQq6ydvSabJ0LN2MvNHANoS_w3lso&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMV_nlmaWXiH2atd0NgGqOMe_OrlZaarjzfQGvl3Z07fw&oe=6ABFCB41"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=buNg3GcfYPMQ7kNvwFTesgX&_nc_oc=Adq_CFtUgYZ1NcviU9LZvbFXliQ3pi4Qwt8fIb9n2SvCSel28UxxFzASatYEKBbOoXw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMj93booUF-XfMBkqB8ZY2qY1L9XWqkRM0oUI8HNMwlJA&oe=6ABFD8A6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i8E6JrErcq4Q7kNvwHEwruY&_nc_oc=Adpxvc5crwj76sbfMkNoYfKoaZ8j_BFpMCOjgnXcmqb733Jteny_W6oERH1i7ZSN2bI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO3Y92u_JzDIYOGS6jCnSx8lo5jEuNyevNhaVSTkVYKqA&oe=6ABFAA5C"}, {"fil